 take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #122005\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n  I've checked to the best of my ability that this should not affect any other behavior: the uniform set is only a descriptor, buffers are still allocated on both paths, and `restart_request` handling is unchanged. I've also tested it extensively on my local projects, but I have to admit that my understanding of Godot rendering pipeline is incomplete so I might have missed some reason for the original ordering.  \r\n\r\n  Possible alternative fixes:\r\n  - re-fetch the uniform set after the update\r\n  - fix the swallowed notification (explained in the issue) - this may be a more generic fix, but it would touch a wider part of the engine.  \r\n\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/rep